From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Graham <matt.sg@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:25:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] nv2a, video: D3D11 and SDL3 GPU renderers, frame
 interpolation

The executor draws through the D3D11 or SDL3 GPU backend on one vertex-pulling
ubershader; upstream's software backend interface stays for tests. The
framebuffer window writes the input key table on both hosts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
